<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Hi {!Lead.FirstName},</font><div style=""><br><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">As promised, here is contact info for one of best lenders. Your next step is to complete the online application for financing. Once you are pre-approved, we will be ready to start building your portfolio together.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style=""><br><font color="#3333ff"><b><u>Please use the link included in Anthony DiToma's contact info</u></b></font> below and complete the application. Anthony's team will reach out to you within 48 hours of receiving your application to introduce themselves and help you obtain the financing approval.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Let me know as soon as you receive your approval for financing, and schedule a call with me using the link in my email as soon you are approved so that we can begin review properties as the become available.</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thanks,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial">Ashley&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="arial" style="background-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif;">Anthony&nbsp;<span class="il" style="">DiToma</span></span><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif;"><u></u><u></u></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Loan Officer – NMLS #13002<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><b><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#000000"><a href="tel:(972)%20447-5694" value="+19724475694" target="_blank" style="">972-447-5694</a>&nbsp;</font>– Direct<u></u><u></u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><b><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="tel:(903)%20421-1264" value="+19034211264" target="_blank" style="">903-421-1264</a>&nbsp;– Cell<u></u><u></u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><b><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="tel:(469)%20461-1356" value="+14694611356" target="_blank" style="">469-461-1356</a>&nbsp;– Fax<u></u><u></u></font></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Britannic Bold&quot;, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">14841 N. Dallas Pkwy - Suite 250 Dallas, TX 75254<u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif;"><a href="mailto:anthony.ditoma@supremelending.com" target="_blank" style=""><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" color="#000000">anthony.<span class="il" style="">ditoma</span>@supremelending.<wbr>com</font></a><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><u></u><u></u></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); margin-right: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></p><p cl